%% Role-based approval workflow (US-11..US-14). Transitions are enforced in the
%% service layer, not merely hidden in the UI (AC-14.1).
stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> DRAFT : create record<br/>(FACULTY, US-06)

    DRAFT --> SUBMITTED : submit<br/>(FACULTY, US-11)
    SUBMITTED --> APPROVED : approve<br/>(ADMIN only, US-12)
    SUBMITTED --> REJECTED : reject + remark<br/>(ADMIN only, US-13)
    REJECTED --> DRAFT : revise<br/>(FACULTY)

    DRAFT --> DRAFT : edit<br/>(FACULTY, US-08)
    REJECTED --> REJECTED : edit<br/>(FACULTY, US-08)

    APPROVED --> [*] : terminal — counts<br/>towards dashboard %

    note right of APPROVED
        AC-12.3: APPROVED is terminal.
        No transition out of it is permitted.
    end note
    note left of SUBMITTED
        Not editable by FACULTY (AC-08.2).
        Any transition outside this machine
        is refused by the service layer.
    end note
